Huh?

511
00:50:31,170 --> 00:50:33,040
What did you say to me?

512
00:50:33,040 --> 00:50:37,060
Say it again. Say it one more time.

513
00:50:37,060 --> 00:50:39,180
What?

514
00:50:39,180 --> 00:50:41,750
You said I was pretty, right?

515
00:50:41,750 --> 00:50:44,310
You said I'm pretty

516
00:50:44,310 --> 00:50:49,240
with your own mouth.

517
00:50:50,090 --> 00:50:53,090
It's not the first time you're hearing that.

518
00:50:53,090 --> 00:50:55,700
Mother calls you pretty at least a few hundred times a day,

519
00:50:55,700 --> 00:50:59,880
and all our family members could die for you, they love you so much.

520
00:50:59,880 --> 00:51:02,950
Joon Soo says you're prettier than me, too.

521
00:51:04,250 --> 00:51:07,860
Your boyfriend probably thinks the same.

522
00:51:09,270 --> 00:51:13,310
Stop pestering me and go home. I need to work.

523
00:51:35,780 --> 00:51:37,820
TV CF Filming Costs

524
00:51:37,820 --> 00:51:42,390
These are the costs of a TV advertisement and putting up posters in every bar.

525
00:51:42,390 --> 00:51:44,600
Re-print it.

526
00:51:49,130 --> 00:51:53,120
Redo it. We don't need an advertisement agency.

527
00:51:53,120 --> 00:51:56,430
Are you going to place an TV ad without an advertising agency?

528
00:51:56,430 --> 00:51:59,960
We don't need a model or, what is that called?

529
00:51:59,960 --> 00:52:04,100
We don't need a content or scenario writer, either.

530
00:52:04,100 --> 00:52:07,670
Just calculate the costs of filming and broadcasting it. Oh, and-

531
00:52:07,670 --> 00:52:11,830
the production team should be the best at what they do.

532
00:52:11,830 --> 00:52:16,390
Make sure to be generous with the funds for that. Same with the poster.

533
00:52:16,390 --> 00:52:22,270
Other than that, try to reduce costs as much as possible in your report.

534
00:52:24,200 --> 00:52:28,830
Do you have anything else to say?

535
00:52:30,270 --> 00:52:33,180
Nope. Please leave.

536
00:52:33,780 --> 00:52:38,550
Do you really not have anything to say?

537
00:52:44,370 --> 00:52:46,490
You really don't?

538
00:52:49,820 --> 00:52:54,000
I understand. I'll leave now.

539
00:53:12,340 --> 00:53:14,900
- Where are we going right now?
- Just be quiet.

540
00:53:14,900 --> 00:53:16,980
Okay. I understand.

541
00:53:21,840 --> 00:53:24,690
- Get out.
- What?

542
00:53:24,690 --> 00:53:26,480
Get out and wait.

543
00:53:26,480 --> 00:53:28,290
What?

544
00:53:28,290 --> 00:53:32,320
I said get out and wait. Call me if even an ant lingers around the area.

545
00:53:32,320 --> 00:53:35,490
- Do you understand?
- Yes.

546
00:54:17,130 --> 00:54:18,730
Get in.

547
00:54:20,800 --> 00:54:26,150
We're going to take Hyo Seon to Do Ga and have her work there.

548
00:54:26,150 --> 00:54:29,230
Eun Jo, you take care of her.

549
00:54:29,810 --> 00:54:34,480
Dad!
- I heard you failed the national ballet club audition.

550
00:54:35,510 --> 00:54:38,730
You fail every audition.

551
00:54:38,730 --> 00:54:41,530
Are you even skilled at ballet?

552
00:54:42,170 --> 00:54:44,510
There isn't much that Hyo Seon can do.

553
00:54:44,510 --> 00:54:46,220
Look for something.

554
00:54:46,220 --> 00:54:50,640
If you and I work together, we'll be able to find something for her to do.

555
00:54:57,450 --> 00:55:01,370
Darling, Eun Jo is enough.

556
00:55:01,370 --> 00:55:04,270
How can someone so young endure here?

557
00:55:04,270 --> 00:55:07,700
She has to play in wide waters to see the world with broad eyes.

558
00:55:07,700 --> 00:55:11,330
You need to have a broad outlook on life to do big things.

559
00:55:11,330 --> 00:55:17,660
I insisted that was true, but he still placed her there.

560
00:55:21,290 --> 00:55:27,940
With the excuse of taking care of the errands in Seoul, I came here

561
00:55:27,940 --> 00:55:31,700
and snuck out to see you, even if it was just for a little bit.

562
00:55:31,700 --> 00:55:35,130
Now, that's all done for.

563
00:55:37,900 --> 00:55:41,280
Drink up. This is our last today.

564
00:55:43,850 --> 00:55:46,850
Who are you to decide this is our last?

565
00:55:49,740 --> 00:55:56,190
That's true. We've had too many lasts, right?

566
00:56:01,050 --> 00:56:03,560
- Kang Soo Ah.
- What?

567
00:56:03,560 --> 00:56:09,020
You should stop working and come back to me.

568
00:56:12,160 --> 00:56:16,030
How can you say something like that? Know your place.

569
00:56:16,710 --> 00:56:20,910
Do you think I hang out with you because I like you?

570
00:56:21,550 --> 00:56:24,330
I've told you hundreds of thousands of times.

571
00:56:24,330 --> 00:56:27,650
I'm only doing this because I think I'll die

572
00:56:27,650 --> 00:56:31,540
if I don't let my stuffy heart breathe freely at least once each month.

573
00:56:31,540 --> 00:56:35,490
- Do you have to speak that way? (Using informal speech)
- How can you address me as you!

574
00:56:35,490 --> 00:56:39,090
I'm someone who's officially married and has a son

575
00:56:39,090 --> 00:56:42,980
with someone who is the CEO of a company.

576
00:56:42,980 --> 00:56:47,130
I'm the wife of a household, that no longer has to be chased around by others.

577
00:56:47,130 --> 00:56:50,230
Do you think I'm the same as someone like you?

578
00:56:58,310 --> 00:57:05,280
I don't even know why you smile when you smile,

579
00:57:05,280 --> 00:57:10,790
or why you're angry when you get angry.

580
00:57:11,450 --> 00:57:14,790
I just don't know anything.

581
00:57:47,790 --> 00:57:50,000
Why are you out here?

582
00:57:55,610 --> 00:57:58,930
Hyo Seon's friends called me,

583
00:57:58,930 --> 00:58:03,060
saying that she drank and passed out somewhere.

584
00:58:03,060 --> 00:58:06,140
Eun Jo and Gi Hoon went to get her.

585
00:58:06,140 --> 00:58:08,630
That little punk really...

586
00:58:11,730 --> 00:58:18,900
Honey, I just met with Hyo Seon's friend because of Hyo Seon.

587
00:58:18,900 --> 00:58:21,120
Let's go inside.

588
00:58:35,340 --> 00:58:37,340
This is Kyung Wha Chung.

589
00:58:42,800 --> 00:58:47,330
Don't you remember anything?

590
01:00:31,650 --> 01:00:33,400
Do you really..

591
01:00:35,610 --> 01:00:38,000
not have anything to say to me?

592
01:01:02,070 --> 01:01:07,870
Do you really not have a single thing to say to me?

593
01:01:07,870 --> 01:01:10,460
You bad wretch.

594
01:01:10,460 --> 01:01:13,700
I don't understand a single thing you're saying.

595
01:01:13,700 --> 01:01:18,340
You horrible girl... How could you act like you don't know me?

596
01:01:20,120 --> 01:01:24,560
Do I have to act like I know you?

597
01:01:24,560 --> 01:01:27,550
- Do you know how much I -
- Shut up.

598
01:01:28,610 --> 01:01:30,340
What?

599
01:01:30,340 --> 01:01:32,290
You crazy bastard.

600
01:01:33,040 --> 01:01:34,850
What?

601
01:01:34,850 --> 01:01:37,580
Whatever I am, or whatever Hyo Seon is,

602
01:01:38,230 --> 01:01:42,640
I didn't know you were a bastard, but you are.

603
01:01:44,130 --> 01:01:45,930
What the hell...

604
01:01:46,980 --> 01:01:48,870
That's not it.

605
01:01:49,680 --> 01:01:53,630
- No?
- It's not Hyo Seon.

606
01:01:54,700 --> 01:01:56,380
Really?

607
01:01:56,380 --> 01:02:00,210
It's not. That's not the truth.

608
01:02:00,210 --> 01:02:03,260
Does Hyo Seon also think that's not the truth?

609
01:02:03,260 --> 01:02:05,260
It's not.

610
01:02:05,260 --> 01:02:08,080
I'm telling you it's not the truth!

611
01:02:09,240 --> 01:02:13,890
What right do you have?

612
01:02:16,380 --> 01:02:18,660
You're fired.

613
01:02:18,660 --> 01:02:21,880
Don't take a single step into this household.

614
01:02:27,290 --> 01:02:28,860
Hey.

615
01:02:30,210 --> 01:02:31,820
Hey!

616
01:02:32,810 --> 01:02:34,590
Eun Jo.

617
01:02:37,170 --> 01:02:39,050
Eun Jo.

618
01:02:46,810 --> 01:02:48,580
Eun Jo...

619
01:02:57,880 --> 01:02:59,720
Eun Jo.

620
01:03:12,780 --> 01:03:16,300
♫ It must be you ♫

621
01:03:16,300 --> 01:03:20,080
♫ I cannot be without you ♫

622
01:03:20,080 --> 01:03:27,030
♫ Like this for another day, month or year ♫

623
01:03:28,390 --> 01:03:30,280
Don't give me your feelings.

624
01:03:30,280 --> 01:03:32,760
I'm a bitch

625
01:03:32,760 --> 01:03:36,360
If you do get a chance to get a hand of it. Please give it to me.

626
01:03:38,480 --> 01:03:41,670
I feel like everything will be taken from me.

627
01:03:42,530 --> 01:03:45,390
It's loyalty to the one who is feeding me.

628
01:03:45,390 --> 01:03:47,670
What's going on with you?

629
01:03:48,600 --> 01:03:50,960
I wish you would just die!

630
01:03:50,960 --> 01:03:53,430
Do you even like Hyo Seon's dad?

631
01:03:53,430 --> 01:03:56,760
♫ Wherever you are ♫

632
01:03:56,760 --> 01:04:02,890
♫ Can't you hear my voice? ♫
